---
import LegalLayout from "@/layouts/legal-layout.astro";
---

<LegalLayout
  canonicalPath="/cookies"
  title="Cookie Policy"
  description="How Docita uses cookies and local browser storage."
  lastUpdated="March 15, 2026"
>
  <section>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">1. What We Use</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      We use essential cookies and local storage to maintain secure sessions,
      remember basic preferences, and keep core workflows reliable.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">2. Why We Use Them</h2>
    <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
      <li>Authentication and session continuity.</li>
      <li>Preference retention such as theme or currency display.</li>
      <li>Operational analytics to improve reliability and UX quality.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">3. Managing Cookies</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      Browser settings allow you to block or clear cookies. Disabling essential
      cookies can prevent login and key product functionality.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">4. Contact</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      Questions about cookie use can be sent to
      <a class="ml-1 text-primary hover:underline" href="mailto:admin@docita.work">admin@docita.work</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</LegalLayout>
